<title>UK: GRE H1 profits slip to 105 mln stg.</title>
<headline>GRE H1 profits slip to 105 mln stg.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30</p>
<p>				 (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		38.9		   vs 17.3</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 3.9		    vs 3.4</p>
<p> Total premium income   1866		   vs 1951</p>
<p> General premiums	 1501		   vs 1544</p>
<p> Life premiums	    365		    vs 407</p>
<p> Trading profit	   105		    vs 137</p>
<p> Pretax		     502		    vs 231</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts had forecast pre-tax profits in a range between 110 and 130 million stg. Dividend forecast at 3.8 pence per share.</p>
<p>Full company name - Guardian Royal Exchange Plc</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
